  "prefLabel": "Per 501.04 Accommodations for Candidates with Disabilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 501.04 Accommodations for Candidates with Disabilities. Upon request, and as required by applicable state or federal law, the director shall provide alternative testing accommodations for a candidate with a disability, including, but not limited to, reading the examination to the candidate.\n\nSource. #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14433, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
